### 
### Memesploding Gameplay Setup Flow
### Uses environment variables from ../http-client.env.json
### In Rider: Select "dev" environment from dropdown before running
### 
### Luồng đúng:
###   Phase 1: Login (3 users)
###   Phase 2: Load CardSets, Create Room, Join
###   Phase 3: Set Ready + Start Match (qua WebSocket AppHub :5217)
###   Phase 4: Sau khi nhận event "RoomMatchStarting" → lấy ticket từ đó
###             Hoặc: GET /rooms/{code} NGAY SAU KHI match đã start
### 

### 
### 1. LOGIN & TOKENS
### 

# @name aliceLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/guest
Content-Type: application/json

{ "deviceId": "{{deviceIdAlice}}" }

> {% 
    client.global.set("aliceToken", response.body.data.accessToken); 
    client.global.set("aliceId", response.body.data.user.id);
    client.global.set("aliceUsername", response.body.data.user.username);
%}

###

# @name bobLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/guest
Content-Type: application/json

{ "deviceId": "{{deviceIdBob}}" }

> {% 
    client.global.set("bobToken", response.body.data.accessToken); 
    client.global.set("bobId", response.body.data.user.id);
    client.global.set("bobUsername", response.body.data.user.username);
%}

###

# @name charlieLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/guest
Content-Type: application/json

{ "deviceId": "{{deviceIdCharlie}}" }

> {% 
    client.global.set("charlieToken", response.body.data.accessToken); 
    client.global.set("charlieId", response.body.data.user.id);
    client.global.set("charlieUsername", response.body.data.user.username);
%}

### 
### 2. CREATE & JOIN ROOM
### 

# @name loadCardSets
GET {{baseUrl}}/card-sets
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}

> {% 
    client.global.set("cardSetId", response.body.data.items[0].id); 
    client.global.set("cardSetName", response.body.data.items[0].name);
%}

###

# @name createRoom
POST {{baseUrl}}/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isPublic": true,
  "maxPlayers": 3,
  "cardSetIds": ["{{cardSetId}}"]
}

> {% 
    client.global.set("roomCode", response.body.data.code); 
%}

###

# @name bobJoin
POST {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomCode}}/join
Authorization: Bearer {{bobToken}}

> {% 
    client.global.set("bobJoinStatus", response.status);
%}

###

# @name charlieJoin
POST {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomCode}}/join
Authorization: Bearer {{charlieToken}}

> {% 
    client.global.set("charlieJoinStatus", response.status);
%}

### 
### 3. SET READY & START MATCH (QUA WEBSOCKET - KHÔNG PHẢI REST)
### 
### ⚠️  SetReadyStatus và StartRoomMatch là SignalR Hub Methods.
###    Phải gọi qua WebSocket kết nối AppHub tại ws://localhost:5217/ws
###    với Authorization Bearer token (accessToken thông thường).
###
### Dùng websocat để test thủ công:
###
### # Alice connect AppHub
### websocat -n 'ws://localhost:5217/ws?access_token={{aliceToken}}'
###
### # Sau khi kết nối, gửi handshake:
### {"protocol":"json","version":1}
###
### # Alice set ready:
### {"type":1,"target":"SetReadyStatus","arguments":["{{roomCode}}",true]}
###
### # Bob + Charlie tương tự với token của họ
###
### # Alice (host) start match:
### {"type":1,"target":"StartRoomMatch","arguments":["{{roomCode}}"]}
###
### Khi match start, mỗi user nhận "RoomMatchStarting" event qua ReceiveMessage:
### {
###   "Event": "RoomMatchStarting",
###   "Data": {
###     "RoomCode": "...",
###     "StartedByUserId": "...",
###     "Connection": {
###       "WsUrl": "ws://localhost:5204/ws",
###       "WsAccessToken": "eyJ..."   ← Dùng token này để vào Game Server
###     }
###   },
###   "Timestamp": "..."
### }
###

### 
### 4. GET GAME TICKET (SAU KHI MATCH ĐÃ START)
### 
### Chỉ chạy request này SAU KHI đã gọi StartRoomMatch qua WebSocket
### Ticket chỉ được cấp khi room đang ở trạng thái "playing"
###

# @name getAliceTicket
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomCode}}
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}

> {% 
    client.global.set("aliceWsAccessToken", response.body.data.connection.wsAccessToken);
    client.global.set("aliceGameWsUrl", response.body.data.connection.wsUrl);
    client.global.set("aliceFullWsUrl", response.body.data.connection.wsUrl + "?access_token=" + response.body.data.connection.wsAccessToken);
%}

###

# @name getBobTicket
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomCode}}
Authorization: Bearer {{bobToken}}

> {% 
    client.global.set("bobWsAccessToken", response.body.data.connection.wsAccessToken);
    client.global.set("bobFullWsUrl", response.body.data.connection.wsUrl + "?access_token=" + response.body.data.connection.wsAccessToken);
%}

###

# @name getCharlieTicket
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomCode}}
Authorization: Bearer {{charlieToken}}

> {% 
    client.global.set("charlieWsAccessToken", response.body.data.connection.wsAccessToken);
    client.global.set("charlieFullWsUrl", response.body.data.connection.wsUrl + "?access_token=" + response.body.data.connection.wsAccessToken);
%}

###
### 5. VERIFY TICKET (kiểm tra token có giá trị không)
### 
### Nếu wsAccessToken là empty string "" → match chưa start hoặc user không ở trong phòng
### Nếu có token → kết nối Game Server: ws://localhost:5204/ws?access_token={token}
###

# @name getRoomDetails
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomCode}}
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}
